  partName: Fuel Cap
  description: The Fuel Cap is a complex, tiny part situated at the middle-center
    of the engine, constructed from high-pressure material. It is essential for sealing
    the fuel system, preventing leaks and maintaining pressure. Notably, its complex
    shape enables a secure and precise connection with the fuel system components.
